      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过通常都是围巾，毛衣或帽子，袜子之类的东西，\n所以我才刻意选择了玩偶――",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef9be5d27928354f3dc0c91d6c824ccf75d6f05d7c5968e44ac91174d84eb32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
