      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "救世主，你回来了……嗯。\n这位女士莫非是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "49739fe4b23100ad2666b7276e05764081b4a19062d1a451b9eaf8070906a47e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
